    "preamble": "In Re:- Joydeb Bera vs Re: An Application For Bail Under ... on 17 November, 2016 Author: Ashim Kumar Roy Bench: Ashim Kumar Roy 1 85 17.11.2016 C.R.M. No. 9250 of 2016 p.d. In re:- Joydeb Bera .... Petitioner. -And- Re: An application for bail under Section 439 Cr.P.C. affirmed on 24.10.2016 in connection with Nandigram Police Station Case No.445/2015 dated 22.10.2015 under Section 272/273 of the Indian Penal Code, West Bengal Act of 42 of 1973, Section 3/328/304/120B of the Indian Penal Code, Section 46AA of Bengal Excise Act and Section 16 (3) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act.",
    "facts": "The petitioner is in custody for one year and although the charge has been framed but trial has not been commenced. Now, the viscera report has been obtained and it is found therefrom that no poison was detected.",
